[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2919851653","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106854#issuecomment-2919851653","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106854","id":2919851653,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uCWaF","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T15:56:09Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T15:56:09Z","body":"Does this need to have a separate menu item in Project? I think there could just be a button added to the find in files dialog instead, like the button in Find Replace bar.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2919851653/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2920654003","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106854#issuecomment-2920654003","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106854","id":2920654003,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uFaSz","user":{"login":"Frozenfire92","id":5893112,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4OTMxMTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5893112?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92","html_url":"https://github.com/Frozenfire92","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T21:42:25Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T00:06:09Z","body":"> Does this need to have a separate menu item in Project?\r\n\r\nI'm not opposed to this one being shortcut/command palette only\r\n\r\n> I think there could just be a button added to the find in files dialog instead, like the button in Find Replace bar.\r\n\r\nThat already exists, It's opening it with `FindInFilesDialog::REPLACE_MODE` adds another input to pre-fill the replacement text in the Search Results\r\n\r\nbut it would be nice if this input could be toggled on from within the dialog\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57578efa-5756-4674-979d-49ed6f6c911f)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd3d0b99-bc29-4e45-a4f3-46e9b481bfe9)\r\n\r\nvs\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd47517c-8f6b-4002-bbb6-cd2ee2547671)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abda056f-665e-4646-8124-5e59edfe5ca6)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2920654003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2923465417","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106854#issuecomment-2923465417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106854","id":2923465417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uQIrJ","user":{"login":"Frozenfire92","id":5893112,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4OTMxMTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5893112?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92","html_url":"https://github.com/Frozenfire92","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T20:56:41Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T20:56:41Z","body":"> However, I am not sure about the location of Find in Files and Replace in Files in the Project menu now that we have two options (and a separator). This effectively moves the location of options like Export quite a lot, which can break users' muscle memory.\r\n\r\nI agree with this. \r\n\r\nI'd be ok with removing the replace option entirely because it feels like an extension of find, and its possible to access replace from starting with find anyways (through search results)\r\n\r\nMy reasoning for having Find in Files be the second thing initially (without the separator) was to be analogous to the Editor menu\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e3c28b7-88df-4886-af4a-781af2584cac)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4244eaeb-429b-4c34-8eeb-f7858b502332)\r\n\r\nI think there are a few options:\r\n\r\n1) leave as is (separator and two options near the top)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/affced0f-8110-4281-9e9a-f20af2f44285)\r\n\r\n2) leave as it was from #106500 with no new Project menu option for replace (but still having global access with keyboard shortcut)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4244eaeb-429b-4c34-8eeb-f7858b502332)\r\n\r\n3) move it further down to above tools with both options\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50d03188-c168-4b2b-8a2a-61565f8c14d3)\r\n\r\n4) move find in files further down above Tools with no replace\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dcff4a15-1e8e-4683-bf7a-c5c047021220)\r\n\r\n5) below the tools menu\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d15c4b71-470d-4e5f-8b1a-6e4392ea341d)\r\n\r\n6) some other configuration\r\n\r\nI'm kind of partial to option 2, but open to feedback/other options. Let me know what you think and I can make the changes","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2923465417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2924659176","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106854#issuecomment-2924659176","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106854","id":2924659176,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uUsHo","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-31T08:17:25Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T08:17:25Z","body":"IMO leaving it as-is (below project settings and with separator) is good.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2924659176/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5296041738","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106854#issuecomment-5296041738","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106854","id":5296041738,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO6svCg","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Re